B.a0q=new A.hd("Choosing jobs & customers","Pick good work. Spot bad ones early.",B.jU,B.a9Q)
B.ZC=new A.b0("YCYC charges mechanics 15% of the job price. The customer pays the job price plus their own 5% service fee on top, which does not come out of your share.")
B.a_4=new A.b0("Example: a 200 dollar job. The fee is 30 dollars, you receive 170 dollars. The customer pays 210 dollars (200 plus their 10 dollar fee).")
B.a_U=new A.b0("Approved additional work follows the same rule.")
B.a85=s([B.ZC,B.a_4,B.a_U],t.f)
B.Y_=new A.bd("m-payouts-fee","The 15% fee","YCYC keeps 15% of the job price. You keep the rest.",B.a85)
B.a8Z=s(["The customer's card is held when they accept your bid and pay.","After the work is done, the customer confirms and releases payment. The money is captured.","Your share goes to your Stripe account. Stripe then pays out to your bank or debit card on your payout schedule."],t.s)
B.a09=new A.hr(B.a8Z)
B.a_H=new A.b0("Bank timing is set by Stripe and your bank, usually a few business days. Check your Earnings screen for the status of each job.")
B.Zp=new A.e0("If a customer neither confirms nor reports a problem, the hold can be released to you automatically before the card authorization expires (often about seven days).")
B.a8M=s([B.a09,B.a_H,B.Zp],t.f)
B.WO=new A.bd("m-payouts-timing","When you get paid","Hold, capture, then Stripe pays you.",B.a8M)
B.a_u=new A.b0("If you have an eligible debit card on Stripe, you can cash out available funds instantly. The fee is 3% of the amount cashed out, with a minimum of 1 dollar. The exact fee and what you will receive are shown in the app before you confirm. Standard payouts to your bank on Stripe's normal schedule have no instant cash-out fee.")
B.Zg=new A.e0("Eligibility depends on Stripe and your card. Not all cards support instant payouts.")
B.a8C=s([B.a_u,B.Zg],t.f)
B.X5=new A.bd("m-payouts-instant","Instant cash-out","Get paid in minutes for a small fee.",B.a8C)
B.aaH=s(["Customer cancels after paying, before work started: 20% of the amount held is the cancellation fee. YCYC takes its usual share and you receive the rest.","Customer cancels after work started: 50% fee, shared the same way.","Customer-fault cancellation by you (wrong parts, parts not ready, or the customer not there or not responding 10 minutes after your arrival): 20% of the job price, of which YCYC keeps 5% and you receive 15%.","Reschedule approved by you: 20% (you have arrived), 10% (you are on the way), 5% (not set off) of the job price. YCYC keeps its 5% in the arrival and on-the-way cases.","You cancel, or you do not show up: no fee, and the customer is not charged."],t.s)
B.Yo=new A.dy(B.aaH)
B.a6S=s([B.Yo],t.f)
B.Y6=new A.bd("m-payouts-cancel","Payouts when a job is cancelled or rescheduled","Who gets what.",B.a6S)
B.a_r=new A.b0("If YCYC decides after review to refund a customer in full or part, the refunded amount is not paid to you, or may be recovered from your future payouts if it was already paid. A bank dispute that the customer wins has the same effect.")
B.a_9=new A.b0("Good records protect you: photos, notes, check-ins and the customer's confirmation.")
B.ace=s([B.a_r,B.a_9],t.f)
B.WS=new A.bd("m-payouts-refunds","Refunds and reversals","What happens if the customer is refunded or disputes.",B.ace)
B.ZY=new A.b0("You are responsible for your own taxes. Stripe may send you tax forms such as a 1099 if you meet the thresholds. Keep your own records of your income.")
B.Za=new A.e0("YCYC cannot give tax advice. Talk to a tax professional.")
B.a8o=s([B.ZY,B.Za],t.f)
B.Xo=new A.bd("m-payouts-tax","Taxes","You are an independent contractor.",B.a8o)
B.a_L=new A.b0("The Earnings screen lists your jobs with amounts, YCYC's fee, and the status of each payout. Use it to check what is pending, what has been paid, and what Stripe still needs from you.")
B.a8W=s([B.a_L],t.f)
