B.a9C=s(["Tap 'I've arrived' at the address so your location is recorded.","Wait 10 minutes after you arrive. The app has no chat or calling, so use that time to double-check the address.","If nobody is there, add a note of at least 10 characters describing what happened, and cancel with the customer-fault reason.","You receive 20% of the job price, and the customer's hold is otherwise released."],t.s)
