B.a01=new A.b0("There is no in-app chat, so show the customer you are coming: tap 'Heading to customer' as soon as you set off, and share your location so they can track you. If you will be very late or cannot make it, cancel as early as you can, before the scheduled time. Cancelling late or not showing up damages your rating and can cost you jobs.")
