B.a6l=s(["Approve: the customer pays the reschedule fee for your stage (20% arrived, 10% on the way, 5% not set off) and confirms the new time.","Decline: the job is cancelled and nobody is charged.","If you do not respond in 48 hours, the request expires."],t.s)
