B.a_Z=new A.b0("If a customer cancels after paying, a cancellation fee applies (20% before work started, 50% after) and you receive your share. If they cancel before paying, nothing is charged. If they cancel because they felt unsafe, or because they say you asked for off-app payment or changed the price, the job is paused for YCYC to review before any money moves.")
B.a82=s([B.a_Z],t.f)
