B.a_o=new A.b0("Open the app, tap 'Don't have an account? Sign up', enter your email and a password, and choose 'Customer' under 'I am a...'. Then tap 'Create account'.")
B.a_p=new A.b0("The first time you sign in you will be asked to read and sign the Customer Agreement. It explains fees, cancellations, holds, refunds and your privacy, so it is worth a read.")
