B.XS=new A.bd("c-start-account","Creating your account","Sign up, choose Customer, and you are ready to post.",B.acg)
B.abu=s(["Tap to post a new job from your home screen.","Pick a saved vehicle, or add a new one (make, model, year).","Enter the service address: where the work will happen. YCYC uses it to send your job to mechanics within about 100 miles.","Describe the problem: noises, warning lights, when it started, anything you have already tried. More detail means better, more accurate bids.","Optional: add photos or a quote you already have from a shop.","Tap 'Post for bids'."],t.s)
B.a0a=new A.hr(B.abu)
B.Z5=new A.e0("Mechanics only see your zip code while bidding. Your full address is shown only to the mechanic you choose, and only after your payment is secured.")
B.a_A=new A.b0("Posting is free. You can cancel for free until you accept a bid and pay.")
B.ab2=s([B.a0a,B.Z5,B.a_A],t.f)
B.WX=new A.bd("c-start-post","Posting a job","Vehicle, address, what is wrong, and photos.",B.ab2)
B.a_m=new A.b0("If you do not know what is wrong, post a diagnostic request instead of a repair. Mechanics bid a number of hours and their hourly rate, and you see the hours, the rate and the total.")
B.aaE=s(["Once you accept, the hours and price are final. The mechanic cannot add time or charges.","The mechanic must send you a written diagnosis through the app: what they found, what they recommend, and whether the car can be driven.","Payment is released only after the diagnosis is sent and you confirm in the app that the mechanic finished diagnosing.","If the mechanic does not find the problem or does not send the written diagnosis, they are not entitled to payment and YCYC may refund you in full."],t.s)
B.Ye=new A.dy(B.aaE)
B.Zj=new A.e0("Any repair the diagnosis recommends is a separate job. You can hire any mechanic for it, including the one who diagnosed it, or none.")
B.aa1=s([B.a_m,B.Ye,B.Zj],t.f)
B.XQ=new A.bd("c-start-diagnostic","Not sure what is wrong? Ask for a diagnostic","Pay a mechanic to find the problem first, then decide on the repair.",B.aa1)
B.a_W=new A.b0("Bids appear on your job as mechanics send them. Only you can see them; mechanics cannot see each other's prices.")
B.ZD=new A.b0("Tap a mechanic's card to open their profile: reviews, years of experience, certifications, whether they carry insurance, mobile or shop, warranty, and more.")
B.a_g=new A.b0("There is no rush. A low price is not the only thing that matters. See 'Choosing a mechanic' for tips.")
B.a8K=s([B.a_W,B.ZD,B.a_g],t.f)
B.XD=new A.bd("c-start-bids","Reading and comparing bids","Price, arrival time, and the mechanic profile.",B.a8K)
B.abG=s(["Open the bid you like and tap 'Accept & pay'.","Review the total. It is the job price plus YCYC's 5% service fee, shown before you confirm.","Pay securely through Stripe. Your card details never touch YCYC's servers."],t.s)
B.a06=new A.hr(B.abG)
B.a_7=new A.b0("Your card is authorized: the money is set aside (it may show as pending on your statement) but it is not paid to the mechanic until you confirm the job is complete, or YCYC releases it as described in the Customer Agreement.")
B.a_v=new A.b0("If you leave the payment screen before finishing, your job shows 'Payment needed to confirm this job'. Tap 'Return to payment' to continue. If you do not want to go ahead, you can still cancel for free.")
B.a8e=s([B.a06,B.a_7,B.a_v],t.f)
B.X9=new A.bd("c-start-accept","Accepting a bid and paying","Your card is held, not charged, until the work is done.",B.a8e)
B.Zs=new A.b0("Your mechanic taps 'Heading to customer' (or 'Heading to parts store') when they set off and 'I've arrived' when they get there. The app records their location at those moments to check they really came to your address.")
B.ab8=s(["Tap 'Track mechanic' to watch their trip on a map when they are sharing it.","Tap 'Ask your mechanic to share location' if you would like to see where they are.","When they arrive, tap 'Confirm mechanic arrived & started work'. Only confirm what is true."],t.s)
B.Yz=new A.dy(B.ab8)
B.Zk=new A.e0("The arrival and start-of-work confirmations matter for cancellation fees. Before both of you have confirmed that work started, a cancellation fee is 20%. After, it is 50%.")
B.aaN=s([B.Zs,B.Yz,B.Zk],t.f)
B.XL=new A.bd("c-start-track","Following your mechanic and confirming arrival","Heading to you, Track mechanic, and the arrival confirmation.",B.aaN)
B.a_S=new A.b0("If your mechanic finds something else that needs fixing, they send a request in the app with a description, a price and optionally photos. You approve or decline each request. Nothing is added to your bill unless you approve it.")
B.a02=new A.b0("Approved extra work is paid for the same way as the main job: held first, released when you confirm.")
B.a0C=new A.hN("Do not agree to extra work or extra payment outside the app. If a mechanic asks for more money in person, ask them to send it as an additional work request, or tell us.")
B.Zl=new A.e0("Diagnostic jobs are different: the hours and price are final, so mechanics cannot add work to a diagnostic.")
B.aaX=s([B.a_S,B.a02,B.a0C,B.Zl],t.f)
B.Xp=new A.bd("c-start-extra","Approving additional work","Your mechanic finds more work; you decide.",B.aaX)
B.ZI=new A.b0("When the mechanic says the work is done, you will be notified. Check the work and the car.")
B.a79=s(["If everything is right, tap 'Review & release payment' and follow the steps to confirm and sign.","Your held payment is then captured and paid out to the mechanic.","Tap 'Leave a review' to rate the mechanic. Honest reviews help other customers."],t.s)
B.a05=new A.hr(B.a79)
B.a0F=new A.hN("Report any problem BEFORE you release payment. Once you confirm, the money is paid out. If a job is never confirmed or reported, the hold can be released to the mechanic automatically before your card authorization expires (often about seven days).")
B.a8L=s([B.ZI,B.a05,B.a0F],t.f)
B.Y2=new A.bd("c-start-finish","Finishing up: release payment and leave a review","Check the work first. Report problems before you release.",B.a8L)
B.a_2=new A.b0("If you already have the parts, switch on 'I have my own parts' on the post-job screen. Mechanics then see a bold flag, 'LABOR QUOTE ONLY, CUSTOMER SUPPLYING PARTS', and bid for labor only. They will not bring parts.")
